('av2', '2nd Avenue Records', 'record', 'Downtown', -122.6726267, 45.5218858, 4.7, 'Daily 12–5 PM', 'Punk · Metal · Vintage tees', '🎸', 'Downtown staple known for its punk and metal depth, band tees, and a welcoming vibe for local musicians.', null, 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJKRqFbgYKlVQR2KaAfCfMNTs', current_date),

